# Agentic flow (this repo)

1. Read `agentic-flow.yaml` and `docs/flow/FLOW-CONFIG.md` before acting.
2. Hard rules: `docs/rules/agent-decisions.md` — stack, reuse, tests are AI decisions.
3. Task artifacts live in `docs/working/<TASK-ID>/` — never rely on chat memory alone.
4. **Carousel-only:** every step ends with AskQuestion; Proceed chains via handoffs (`docs/flow/carousel-chain.md`). User never types commands.
5. **Build gate:** after every step run `app.verify` from `agentic-flow.yaml` — exit 0 before carousel (`docs/flow/app-build-verify.md`).
6. Plan-agent first → orchestrator executes one specialist per turn.
7. Do not commit unless the user asks.

**Walkthrough:** `docs/flow/CURSOR-FLOW.md`
